47a9bc102ff39b31c92bf0cd6982bf7fcb53f0740daacbd7e233e552","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Current Boss Actor: %s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目前Boss角色：%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4838269f63b079b621c854acfd830fbcbc94c71243868ccb6474489ae16bf305","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"88fa97aa600bacbd0b28ec78729f14fb9b749bf7b2a2e258aed9e31c70dfe436","logical_entry_identity":"136ad7e02414f89b27c3e1d6bfb8941128f3fffde0f236bcceff7dc359ebce3c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Inner Demons","source_tag":"_t","target":"心魔"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d9c456ec5cc61bdbf376e8d98b80973158b3c1683555c74bde18d2fb2c8420d6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8902557c4cf19c0612a2d98e6e9346196e158ed414fda5c70cb0d5da71f08c8e","logical_entry_identity":"14d93891734918b8e2e0f74aa47d5d84797493e83104407a053d079d768ebad7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Creates a circle of radius %d at your feet; the circle slows incoming projectiles by %d%% and attempts to push all creatures other than yourself out of its radius, inflicting %0.2f light damage and %0.2f darkness damage per turn as it does so.  The circle lasts %d turns.\n\t\tThe effects will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在你的脚下制造一个 %d 码半径范围的法阵，它会减慢 %d%% 抛射物速度并将除你外的其他生物推出去。\n\t\t同时，每回合对目标造成 %0.2f 光系伤害和 %0.2f 暗影伤害。\n\t\t法阵持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t效果受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"27a5c6ed6fca2266b3820c4470dce8f32653bab82d0f7b1c8decd846cf7a4b84","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8902887ba3dd9d96339926d39f2709da361aa1716db72c97c8f3381601165354","logical_entry_identity":"41309b5897b8dc514ae5d22b31a50ee3a3bed843a93e6202a2b3b8c6dddc1a2a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#VIOLET#Images of yourself beating people with a stick spring into your mind. (Staff Combat category can be bought)","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#VIOLET#你用木棒击打敌人的镜像进入了你的大脑。（能购买法杖格斗系）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b91ec06fecee5dd16d686bee5df3e930f280fcd43ee7029be1b885f350d5fd2a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8904128732b26f87249297e3a1fe1205f02db57abe629969e7cddcbae1bcbccc","logical_entry_identity":"913e29cdb7ad499c47bb6d38ab657f1c6d4f36669ab38ad8b7bb8b21d748b51c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#Relle, Cornac Fighter & Expedition Captain#{normal}#\nNothing but hatchlings so far. Honestly, if this keeps up we won't have enough dragonhide to cover a dragon, let alone cover our losses. I've really spared no expense this time as well: Gorran is one of the finest rangers I know, and Sodelost... his prices are exorbitant, but then what else would you expect from those money-grubbing dwarven Thronesmen? I must admit I don't know much about Xann. The locals say there's no finer wyrmic in the area, and I admit she is something special in combat. Now, if only she could turn her draconic talents to FINDING some dragons!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#探险队队长，科纳克人战士瑞丽#{normal}#\n到目前为止只遇上了幼龙。老实说，照这样下去，我们得到的龙皮连一条龙都盖不住，更别说弥补损失了。这次我也确实不惜血本：高岚是我认识的最优秀的巡林客之一；至于苏达罗斯特……他的要价高得离谱，不过钢铁王座那群贪财的矮人还能是什么样？我得承认，自己并不了解希安。当地人说这一带没有比她更出色的龙战士，而她在战斗中确实不同凡响。现在只盼她能把操控龙族力量的本事用来找出几条龙！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3f0b1867428a5ccdbe6a84c07e0709308290bbad39379c3f92371ed9bb7fa65e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"890a5abc799b2442d49ff8b68830dfa4e2205d4e45ce7eba7e0bff0eb7971fa9","logical_entry_identity":"c0aa98fe9c8a038b4e3a0f281c0e8a2eeebc7221a20c7bde5c0c2e544e99839f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"ethereal boots","source_tag":"_t","target":"飘渺的靴子"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a89ec09a8dc4ddab29b6c9df2f146314539b0830c720a4c20734059b7cd2a0ca","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"890ee1f06024644ac761bfe91356a8cae3b70a98c4fd3a17451e84f4b4ce27d0","logical_entry_identity":"b4d439aa4582f8e60cea85c5ca707bdac3df5fcc49d5d26f07022f0cdcafb2a6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GREY#%s has fed on enough minions and starts to randomly hex foes!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#GREY#%s吸取了足够多的随从，开始随机对敌人释放邪术！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aa785f5a6e9655463519f9ca824e6a0f8750097a6c978306a20aa38ad9a73b53","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"890eec11497dc6c7e004e633981bbd8a11534f6ba97aa9b522ad8cf8f51c1daf","logical_entry_identity":"1cb54b3041d1fe01c1b3fe01685678a0b7bf33c986044bb34f7e373b6311b337","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Gnaw your target for %d%% damage.  If your attack hits, the target may be infected with Ghoul Rot for %d turns.\n\t\tEach turn, Ghoul Rot inflicts %0.2f blight damage.\n\t\tTargets suffering from Ghoul Rot rise as friendly ghouls when slain.\n\t\tGhouls last for %d turns and can use Gnaw, Ghoulish Leap, Stun, and Rotting Disease.\n\t\tThe blight damage scales with your Constitution.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"啃噬目标，造成 %d%% 伤害。\n\t\t如果你的攻击命中，目标会感染食尸鬼腐烂疫病持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t食尸鬼腐烂疫病每回合造成 %0.2f 枯萎伤害。\n\t\t目标被杀死时会变成你的可以完全控制的食尸鬼傀儡。\n\t\t食尸鬼傀儡持续 %d 回合，可以使用啃噬、食尸鬼跳跃、震慑和腐烂疫病。\n\t\t受体质影响，枯萎伤害按比例加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1b61b8c133d605379e7ce1dd6b0e0f7b10de4b15fb0e5bd0e65b50701077ad6c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"891922dc23a16c9f769816aefb41e6c3f7131a35fc791a6b7a5b6e1f7648978e","logical_entry_identity":"7df42216cb961a8674165493b81108822c28559842b8182aa77cc91b4ba9d5e8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#YELLOW_GREEN##Source#'s healing is amplified!","source_tag":"delayedLogMessage","target":"#YELLOW_GREEN##Source#的治疗被增幅了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b0feae6abfc9a43388cc10a6f2f47838ea2501ad2d277fc17ac1a53049fd30fe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"891de410a8473f6e7169b67c4856337e1f616dde50f746cb4545a0638085bf9d","logical_entry_identity":"749a7e1863a96028900b3699f218efce3063696f6d7aef79b92132f3d1a2688f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*A human robed in immaculate white satin opens the door and eyes you appraisingly.*#WHITE#\nAh, an adventurer. I was just thinking that I needed a new one.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*一名身着一尘不染白缎长袍的人类打开了门，审视地打量着你。*#WHITE#\n啊，一位冒险者。我正想着我需要个新的帮手呢。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ecee3852d70b491399288e2d2e860db70da9242215a1ef94a5bb9f670bb7edd5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"891f93531abe26375ac4d005865ae91f7857adfbb07d1da96649c2bfe76600f5","logical_entry_identity":"335ee3492f4fdc7410d5ffdc596561edea10c019d0907cb3c6d2e30ebdb2a9bc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"It looks awake, beware!","source_tag":"_t","target":"它醒来了，小心！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6ec9d79a9b9e7146ecd1bfe18b6733059a3a7341195425a446cb8e598b1a2bd5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8924b56606c61caebd3af746adc6f71b735e6b556614626156164a5fe2f65988","logical_entry_identity":"32a569912bbd7196343d18eee8d3589d7b7e9ad076e4f1b730fee5894d38c479","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The smith spends some time with you, teaching you the basics of armour and weapon usage.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"铁匠花了一些时间，教你武器和护甲的基础使用方法。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}